    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS...are honoured to offer a truly spectacular 3 bedroom, 2 bathroom mid-terraced duplex that is presented in turn-key condition throughout and extends to approximately 110m² / 1,184ft² on two spacious levels. This luxurious home is positioned discreetly in an excellent location, in the highly sought after and peaceful All Hallows development, just off Griffith Avenue. No. 18 can be easily accessed by vehicle, or by a pedestrian walkway via Church Avenue. The stunning home enjoys a generous and bright living space with two private balconies and two designated car parking spaces which are surrounded by beautifully landscaped internal courtyards and manicured communal lawns. This home benefits from an excellent B3 BER rating, which means it may qualify for a lower-rate Green Mortgage for the new owners. \r\n\r\nMeticulously refurbished throughout, the property has been thoughtfully upgraded to a high standard, resulting in a home presented in excellent decorative order while retaining its abundance of charm. No stone has been left unturned in creating a beautiful, future-proofed home where a family-friendly practical layout is complemented by wonderful features and understated luxury. Upon entering, a welcoming entrance hall with Spanish tiles immediately sets the tone for this contemporary modern home. The hallway features excellent natural light, and ample space for coat storage, with a downstairs WC for guests. The home comprises of an expansive open-plan reception room to the rear, perfect for everyday family life and ideal for entertaining. It features high-quality flooring throughout, dual-aspect natural light, with plenty of space for both a large dining table and spacious suite of furniture. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors open directly onto one of two private balconies, which overlooks the picturesque, landscaped grounds. The home also enjoys a spacious modern kitchen and breakfast room located directly off the hall. The kitchen is equipped with built in wall and base cabinetry, tiled splashbacks, modern integrated appliances, and generous countertop preparation space, providing a practical environment got everyday cooking. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation continues with three generously proportioned double bedrooms. The master bedroom is particularly impressive with built in wardrobes, an en-suite bathroom with dual aspect, and access to a second private balcony enjoying a westerly orientation. This additional outdoor space provides another quiet relaxation spot to absorb the tranquillity of this wonderful hidden secret. The property boasts two separate private balconies overlooking attractive private landscaped grounds. The grounds include communal lawns, mature trees, and beautiful internal gardens, which is a peaceful escape from the busy village of Drumcondra. The duplex also contains two private off-street parking spaces which are an added feature. \r\n\r\nThe location is one of the property's best assets. All Hallows is positioned just off Griffith Avenue, in a mature residential setting, just moments away from Drumcondra’s excellent amenities, through private pedestrian access to Church Avenue. The area is well served by public transport routes with many Dublin Bus routes and Drumcondra station nearby. This provides easy access to Dublin City Centre. There is choice of many cafés, shops, restaurants, bars, and services at your doorstep. There are also many recreational amenities, schools, and sports clubs within reach, including Dublin City University. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all this wonderful home has to offer, and by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... 01-8844 690"
      },
